<title>UK: LOW &amp; BONAR BUYS BTR UNIT FOR 11 MLN STG.</title>
<headline>LOW &amp; BONAR BUYS BTR UNIT FOR 11 MLN STG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>British plastics and packaging group Low &amp; Bonar Plc said on Monday it acquired Nuway Manufacturing from BTR Plc for 11 million stg in cash.</p>
</text>
